// # Sovereign Media, Codecs & Vision Master Façade
//
// Logline: Unified standard library package providing H.264 video, Quite OK Image (QOI), and RIFF/WAVE audio codecs.
//
// Setup: Root multimedia processing package re-exporting video, image, and audio engines.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Re-export H.264 Annex B start-code parsers and SPS parameter decoders.
//   2. Re-export Quite OK Image (QOI) lossless encoders and decoders.
//   3. Re-export RIFF/WAVE PCM audio parsers, encoders, and multi-track mixers.

